Subject: [PATCH] ico: reject a BMP height that halves to zero

Open upstream as image-rs/image#3041, the same approach, which maintainers
declined in favour of Windows behaviour (fall back to the ICONDIR entry size).
That is image-rs/image#3042, also open. Drop this patch once #3042 lands.

diff --git a/src/codecs/bmp/decoder.rs b/src/codecs/bmp/decoder.rs
index 691be7b..c8f4a21 100644
--- a/src/codecs/bmp/decoder.rs
+++ b/src/codecs/bmp/decoder.rs
@@ -1756,6 +1756,9 @@ impl<R: BufRead + Seek> BmpDecoder<R> {
         // The height field in an ICO file is doubled to account for the AND mask
         // (whether or not an AND mask is actually present).
         self.height /= 2;
+        if self.height <= 0 {
+            return Err(DecoderError::InvalidHeight.into());
+        }
         Ok(())
     }
 
